    feat(metrics): Prometheus exposition at GET /metrics/prom (OBS-OB-001)
    
    Five Tier-1 obo_* families on a private registry via client_golang+promhttp:
    obo_http_up, obo_cron_loop_running, obo_solves_total{outcome},
    obo_queue_pending (same Depth /api/v1/stats serves), and
    obo_solve_duration_seconds{outcome} fed per-completed-solve from the cron
    loop Metrics (previously dead code) via SetDurationObserver.
    
    Recovered from an abandoned prior-tick worker that left the implementation
    uncommitted; verified against the task criteria on a readonly scratch
    instance (200 + text/plain; version=0.0.4, 5 families, obo_queue_pending
    == queue_depth, JSON /metrics byte-compatible) before commit.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
